# Data-gateway edge function name. Defaults to the production "orm-gateway".
# During the snapshot → per-page data migration, set this to "orm-gateway-next"
# in dev to target the separately-deployed WIP gateway so production traffic
# never hits unreviewed gateway changes. See docs/reference/snapshot-migration.md.
# VITE_ORM_GATEWAY_FUNCTION=orm-gateway-next

# Legacy CRM-integration Supabase project (separate from the main project).
